%% expect: Görüntüleyici|Motor işlemi|Dosya izleyici|Dosya değişti, yeniden çiz|Render every Mermaid block in the visible range|Parallel work|Kill the process after five seconds|Wrap this long note|across several lines|show source
sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Kullanıcı
    participant V as Görüntüleyici
    participant E as Motor işlemi
    participant W as Dosya izleyici
    U->>V: Open a very large README from the recent files list
    W-)V: Dosya değişti, yeniden çiz
    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        par Parallel work
            V->>E: Render every Mermaid block in the visible range
        and
            V->>E: Highlight the code blocks
        end
    end
    E-->>V: Finished images<br/>and measured sizes
    Note right of E: Wrap this long note<br/>across several lines<br/>to see whether it fits
    critical Hostile diagram
        V->>E: Render a diagram that never finishes
    option Timeout
        V->>E: Kill the process after five seconds
        V-->>U: show source
    end
